    "sections": {
        "description": "The Flex Fast Food and Repair Shop Theme is a purpose-built solution designed for restaurants, fast food outlets, cafes, repair shops, and service centers looking to create a professional and engaging online presence. For food businesses, it showcases menu items, online food ordering, takeaway services, special offers, combos, fast food delivery, and chef specials. For repair services, it covers express laptop repair, affordable gadget repair, certified repair services, touchscreen repair, laptop fan replacement, circuit board repair, phone sensor repair, tablet camera repair, network issue repair, and Wi-Fi troubleshooting. The theme offers a user-friendly interface, fully responsive design, and customizable layouts for seamless navigation across desktops, tablets, and smartphones. It includes dedicated sections for online bookings, service descriptions, customer testimonials, blog posts for repair or food tips, and marketing promotions. SEO-optimized and fast-loading, the theme also supports lead generation, online orders, and client inquiries through the Contact Form 7 plugin, making it ideal for food outlets, independent repair centers, bulk service providers, and businesses seeking to elevate their digital presence efficiently."
    },
